Tokio, Hyper, tungstenite, numerical/JSON crates and operating-system interfaces
are external dependencies. Project-owned receiver/publisher policy is Rust.
The original Python files are used only by verification tools.

Python string representation uses unicode-general-category 0.6.0 (Apache-2.0),
whose Unicode 15.0 data matches the CPython 3.12 source oracle.
